"Actions                                                                                                                 "
" j  move down                           c  Commit …                                                                     "
" k  move up                               c  Commit                                                                     "
" gg  go to top                            e  Extend                                                                     "
" G  go to bottom                          a  Amend                                                                      "
" <c-d>  half page down                    w  Reword                                                                     "
" <c-u>  half page up                    b  Branch …                                                                     "
" v  mark the file or folder viewed        b  Checkout branch                                                            "
" <c-n>  next section                      c  Create and checkout                                                        "
" <c-p>  previous section                  n  Create                                                                     "
" <tab>  fold / unfold                     D  Delete                                                                     "
" s  stage file or hunk                    p  Pull requests                                                              "
" u  unstage file or hunk                  P  Open a pull request                                                        "
" S  stage everything                    d  Diff against …                                                               "
" U  unstage everything                    d  Base branch                                                                "
" x  discard changes                       c  Last commit                                                                "
" <c-r>  refresh                           b  A branch                                                                   "
" <cr>  open the item under the cursor     s  A commit from the log                                                      "
" D  open the full working-tree diff       w  HEAD (working tree)                                                        "
" T  switch theme                        l  Log …                                                                        "
" o  open CI runs                          l  Current branch                                                             "
" [  previous hunk                       P  Push …                                                                       "
" ]  next hunk                             p  Push                                                                       "
" e  open in $EDITOR                       u  Push and set upstream                                                      "
" Z  send feedback to waiting agents     p  Pull …                                                                       "
" C  overview of every comment             p  Pull                                                                       "
" /  search                              f  Fetch …                                                                      "
" n  next search match                     f  Fetch                                                                      "
